  "disabled and read-only pairing > disabled requires disabledTooltip > a disabled control has to say why": "TS2741: Property ''\`disabled\` needs \`disabledTooltip\`, a disabled control has to tell the user why it cannot be used'' is missing in type '{ disabled: true; }' but required in type 'ADisabledInputMustSayWhy'.",
  "disabled and read-only pairing > disabledTooltip requires disabled > the reason only renders while \`disabled\` is set": "TS2741: Property ''\`disabledTooltip\` only renders while \`disabled\` is set, add \`disabled\` or drop the tooltip'' is missing in type '{ disabledTooltip: string; }' but required in type 'ADisabledReasonNeedsADisabledInput'.",
  "disabled and read-only pairing > readOnly requires readOnlyTooltip > a locked control has to say why": "TS2741: Property ''\`readOnly\` needs \`readOnlyTooltip\`, a locked control has to tell the user why it cannot change'' is missing in type '{ readOnly: boolean | undefined; }' but required in type 'AReadOnlyInputMustSayWhy'.",
